# Z80 breadboard computer — standalone circuit.
#
# The bench is the deliverable here: Z80 + RAM + ROM + MC6850 with
# 74HC00 decode, wired like the real build, and bw-board's
# extractZ80Machine turns exactly this wiring into the machine config
# (memory regions + the I/O-mapped ACIA).
#
# There is no DEVICE Z80 program axis in the transpiler yet — when the
# Z80 generateC/generateASM core lands, this line gains a real program;
# until then a fake DEVICE line would only teach the gallery to lie.
